description:
Design a 4-bit binary adder with carry lookahead functionality. This module takes two 4-bit input operands, `a` and `b`, along with a carry-in (`c_in`). It computes the sum of the inputs and generates a carry-out signal for each bit, allowing for faster propagation of carry values across the bits compared to a simple ripple-carry adder. The outputs include a 4-bit sum and a 4-bit carry signal indicating the carry generated from each bit position.
module top_module(output wire [3:0]sum, carry_ahead,
                        input wire [3:0] a, b,
                        input wire c_in

);

